From d69ae816880803bdbcc5090c01bdd26c136bc363 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cole Faust <colefaust@google.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Jun 2025 10:02:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Revert "Report which files are in the dependency graph
 for dist builds."

This reverts commit d6a2999a5a6ba7ef84e4ad37d09be34c80605e06.

This file was never used, Joeo (who added it) left google, and it's
causing 30+ minute slowdowns on certain builds.

Bug: 427610121
Bug: 383124666
Test: Presubmits
Change-Id: Ib0bbd986a44819e0664bdca05c92aeb44392a3bf
